Package: plakar-pve-provider
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: perl
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Gilles DUBOIS <gilles.dubois@factorfx.com>
Depends: libpve-storage-perl, libjson-perl, pve-qemu-kvm
Description: Plakar backup provider for Proxmox VE
 Storage plugin of type "plakar" that lets vzdump hand each VM disk to
 Plakar as a raw NBD export, so backups deduplicate across runs.
